+# The jeffy loop's own state files and working directories. These are the
+# project's memory between runs, not part of the library, and the composer
+# dist archive is built from this file: without these lines every checkpoint
+# ships them to every consumer of the package.
+/PLAN.md export-ignore
+/BACKLOG.md export-ignore
+/JOURNAL.md export-ignore
+/JOURNAL-archive.md export-ignore
+/.jeffy export-ignore
+/.claude export-ignore
